    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceship Killer is a multiplayer strategy and deduction game. In this game you\u00a0 Players are divided into two factions: Peacemakers and Hunters. Peacemakers need to donate enough coins  or identify and kill the Hunters, while Hunters must disguise themselves as Peacemakers and sabotage them secretly.<br>You can play online with 4-10 other players and try to collect coins to achieve peace goals, but be careful, at least one player will be randomly assigned to be a hunter who wants to kill them all!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the built-in voice chat to communicate and cooperate with other players.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the task to get gold, and use the gold to buy useful items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various items to communicate with other people, kill enemies, and vote out players who are different from your faction.</p></li></ul>",
